OL,3,GNEWSAFive out of 10 local authority
OL,4,Aby-elections to take place
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere are to be five local authority
OL,7,Fby-elections across the Isle of man
OL,8,Fnext month, after five of the 10
OL,9,Fvacancies went uncontested.
OL,11,FIt comes after several people called
OL,12,Ffor residents to stand as commissioners
OL,13,Ffor their local areas and represent
OL,14,Fratepayers.
OL,16,FContests will take place in Arbory and
OL,17,FRushen, Garff (Laxey ward), Peel, Port
OL,18,FSt Mary, and Ramsey (north and south
OL,19,Fward).
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
